0 // Two bars 4 studs long, one stud apart (LDraw y = -10 and 10), joined by four short uprights.
0 // Clips and bar holes can take either long bar; clips can also grip an upright between the bars.
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=M] [caps=none] [secs=R 4 80] [center=true] [slide=true] [pos=0 -10 0] [ori=0 -1 0 1 0 0 0 0 1]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=M] [caps=none] [secs=R 4 80] [center=true] [slide=true] [pos=0 10 0] [ori=0 -1 0 1 0 0 0 0 1]
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=M] [caps=none] [secs=R 4 12] [center=true] [slide=true] [pos=-30 0 0]
